Package: imurun
Title: Spreadsheet-First Front-End for 'imuGAP'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    c(person("Carl", "Pearson", email = "carl.ab.pearson@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0701-7860")),
      person("Claire Perrin", "Smith", role = "aut",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-1069-9460")),
      person("Weston", "Voglesonger", email = "westonvogle@gmail.com", role = "ctb"))
Description: A spreadsheet-first front-end to the 'imuGAP' model-fitting
    package for users who are comfortable at the R prompt without being power
    R users. Reads model inputs and sampler configuration from an 'xlsx'
    workbook (or data frames from CSV or RDS files), validates them against the
    canonical 'imuGAP' schema, runs a fit, and writes summarized estimates back
    into the workbook. The engine functions are exported for direct R use, with
    an optional bundled command-line wrapper.
